I added `expiringSoon` right after `liveTokens`. It sums `left` over batches that are live on `day` but not live on `day + within`, reusing `isLive`, so the 180-day rule and batches bought after `day` are handled the same way as elsewhere. It only reads the wallet, so nothing is changed.

I made a `within` of 0 or less return 0. You only specified 0, so the negative case is my own choice.
